{%- comment -%}
  Big dark-green FAQ: left-aligned two-line headline, stacked translucent
  rows with circle chevron buttons.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section class="lpq">
  <div class="lp-wrap">
    <h2 class="lp-h2 lp-h2--w">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

    <details class="lpq-item"><summary>What exactly does Pinemoor do? <span class="lpq-btn" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary>
      <div class="lpq-body"><p>Ticks find you by smell. Pinemoor&rsquo;s six botanicals absorb and exit through your skin, changing the scent you give off so ticks stop reading you as a host &mdash; and climb off before they bite.</p></div>
    </details>
    <details class="lpq-item"><summary>How fast will I see results? <span class="lpq-btn" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary>
      <div class="lpq-body"><p>Your first dropper absorbs within the hour. Day 3&ndash;5 is the window where most customers report complete repellence, and one morning dose then holds for up to 24 hours.</p></div>
    </details>
    <details class="lpq-item"><summary>How do I take it? <span class="lpq-btn" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary>
      <div class="lpq-body"><p>One full dropper daily with water, coffee, or juice &mdash; or straight under the tongue. It tastes like pure maple syrup, so kids don&rsquo;t argue.</p></div>
    </details>
    <details class="lpq-item"><summary>Will it make me smell different? <span class="lpq-btn" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary>
      <div class="lpq-body"><p>Not to people. The shift happens at the level ticks smell, not humans &mdash; no odor, no grease, nothing on your clothes or gear.</p></div>
    </details>
    <details class="lpq-item"><summary>Is it safe for daily use? <span class="lpq-btn" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary>
      <div class="lpq-body"><p>Yes &mdash; it&rsquo;s crafted for consistent daily use through the whole season, with no DEET, no permethrin, and no synthetic pesticides.</p></div>
    </details>
    <details class="lpq-item"><summary>Where is it made? <span class="lpq-btn" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary>
      <div class="lpq-body"><p>Blended and bottled in the US in a GMP-compliant facility, and shipped from the US with tracked delivery.</p></div>
    </details>
    <details class="lpq-item"><summary>What if it doesn&rsquo;t work for me? <span class="lpq-btn" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary>
      <div class="lpq-body"><p>Then it&rsquo;s free. Every order is covered by our Lifetime Money-Back Guarantee &mdash; return it at any time for a full refund. No deadlines, no questions.</p></div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
#shopify-section-{{ section.id }}{content-visibility:auto;contain-intrinsic-size:auto 1100px;}
.lpq{background:var(--lpg-mid);padding:46px 0 52px;}
.lpq-item{background:var(--lpg-row);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-radius:12px;margin-top:18px;overflow:hidden;}
.lpq-item:first-of-type{margin-top:28px;}
.lpq-item summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:28px 20px;
  font-family:var(--lp-body);font-size:20px;font-weight:500;color:#fff;line-height:1.3;}
.lpq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
.lpq-btn{flex:none;margin-left:auto;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--lp-mint);color:var(--lpg-deep);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:transform .25s;}
.lpq-btn svg{width:15px;height:15px;}
.lpq-item[open] .lpq-btn{transform:rotate(90deg);}
.lpq-body{padding:0 20px 24px;}
.lpq-body p{font-family:var(--lp-body);font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.55;color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);}
</style>

{% schema %}{"name":"LP Big FAQ","settings":[]}{% endschema %}
